casebook a-46cfr-58_10-15-gas-turbine-draft v1
source "A-46cfr-58.10-15-gas-turbine.txt" dated 2026-10-14 by "drafted by anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 from the manual; not yet approved"
note "UNAPPROVED DRAFT: written by a language model from A-46cfr-58.10-15-gas-turbine.txt. Every declaration below cites the sentence"
note "it came from. Check each against the manual, add what the manual does not say, then delete"
note "this note to approve. quorum studio will not build a chip image while it is here."

# manual: "Low lubricating oil pressure."
observe low_oil_pressure "low lubricating oil pressure"

# manual: "suitable antifriction bearings are fitted"
observe antifriction_bearings "suitable antifriction bearings are fitted"

# manual: "Excessive gas temperature, measured at the turbine inlet, gas generator, interstage turbine or turbine exhaust."
observe gas_temp_high "excessive gas temperature at turbine inlet, gas generator, interstage turbine or turbine exhaust"

# manual: "Excessive lubricating oil temperature."
observe oil_temp_high "excessive lubricating oil temperature"

# manual: "Excessive speed"
observe excessive_speed "excessive speed"

# manual: "Reduced lubricating oil pressure."
observe reduced_oil_pressure "reduced lubricating oil pressure"

# manual: "Gas turbine exhausts must not be interconnected with boiler uptakes"
observe exhaust_interconnected "gas turbine exhaust is interconnected with a boiler uptake"

# manual: "except for gas turbines used for emergency power and lighting or for emergency propulsion"
observe emergency_turbine_use "gas turbine is used for emergency power and lighting or for emergency propulsion"

# manual: "Interconnected exhausts must be specifically approved by the Commandant."
observe exhaust_approved "the interconnected exhaust has been specifically approved by the Commandant"

# manual: "A gas turbine air inlet must not be in a classified location."
observe air_inlet_in_classified_location "gas turbine air inlet is located in a classified location"

# manual: "Automatic shutdown must occur under the following conditions: (i) Overspeed."
observe overspeed "engine overspeed"

# manual: "A gas turbine exhaust on a mobile offshore drilling unit must not discharge in a classified location."
observe exhaust_in_classified_location "gas turbine exhaust on a mobile offshore drilling unit discharges in a classified location"

# manual: "Consideration will be given providing alarm only (without shutdown) in those cases where suitable antifriction bearings are fitted."
excuse antifriction_alarm_only "with suitable antifriction bearings, alarm only without shutdown may be accepted" needs antifriction_bearings

# manual: "Low lubricating oil pressure."
claim low_oil_fault "low lubricating oil pressure requiring automatic shutdown" severity 8 needs low_oil_pressure

# manual: "Excessive gas temperature, measured at the turbine inlet, gas generator, interstage turbine or turbine exhaust."
claim gas_temp_alarm "excessive gas temperature alarm" severity 5 needs gas_temp_high

# manual: "Excessive lubricating oil temperature."
claim oil_temp_alarm "excessive lubricating oil temperature alarm" severity 5 needs oil_temp_high

# manual: "Excessive speed"
claim speed_alarm "excessive speed alarm" severity 5 needs excessive_speed

# manual: "Reduced lubricating oil pressure."
claim oil_pressure_alarm "reduced lubricating oil pressure alarm" severity 5 needs reduced_oil_pressure

# manual: "Low lubricating oil pressure. Consideration will be given providing alarm only (without shutdown) in those cases where suitable antifriction bearings are fitted."
claim low_oil_alarm "low lubricating oil pressure with suitable antifriction bearings: alarm only" severity 5 needs low_oil_pressure antifriction_bearings

# manual: "Gas turbine exhausts must not be interconnected with boiler uptakes"
claim prohibited_exhaust_interconnection "gas turbine exhaust interconnected with boiler uptake, which is not permitted" severity 5 needs exhaust_interconnected

# manual: "except for gas turbines used for emergency power and lighting or for emergency propulsion"
excuse emergency_turbine_exception "interconnection is allowed for gas turbines used for emergency power and lighting or emergency propulsion" needs emergency_turbine_use

# manual: "Interconnected exhausts must be specifically approved by the Commandant."
claim unapproved_exhaust_interconnection "exhaust is interconnected without specific approval by the Commandant" severity 5 needs exhaust_interconnected

# manual: "A gas turbine air inlet must not be in a classified location."
claim air_inlet_classified_location_fault "gas turbine air inlet in a classified location, which is not permitted" severity 5 needs air_inlet_in_classified_location

# manual: "Automatic shutdown must occur under the following conditions: (i) Overspeed."
claim overspeed_fault "overspeed requiring automatic shutdown" severity 9 needs overspeed

# manual: "A gas turbine exhaust on a mobile offshore drilling unit must not discharge in a classified location."
claim exhaust_classified_location_fault "gas turbine exhaust discharging in a classified location, which is not permitted" severity 5 needs exhaust_in_classified_location

# manual: "Consideration will be given providing alarm only (without shutdown) in those cases where suitable antifriction bearings are fitted."
antifriction_alarm_only undercuts low_oil_fault

# manual: "except for gas turbines used for emergency power and lighting or for emergency propulsion"
emergency_turbine_exception undercuts prohibited_exhaust_interconnection

# manual: "Interconnected exhausts must be specifically approved by the Commandant."
exhaust_approved rebuts unapproved_exhaust_interconnection

# manual: "Audible or visible alarms must also be provided for:"
action raise_alarm when any low_oil_alarm gas_temp_alarm oil_temp_alarm speed_alarm oil_pressure_alarm

# manual: "Automatic shutdown must occur under the following conditions:"
action keep_running idle

# manual: "The control system must be designed for automatic shutdown of the engine with actuation of audible and visible alarms at shutdown."
action shutdown_engine safe when any overspeed_fault low_oil_fault

# manual: "A gas turbine air inlet must not be in a classified location."
action report_noncompliance when any air_inlet_classified_location_fault prohibited_exhaust_interconnection unapproved_exhaust_interconnection exhaust_classified_location_fault

# manual: "Automatic shutdown must occur under the following conditions:"
prefer shutdown_engine over raise_alarm over report_noncompliance over keep_running
